+
+    targetButtonSize() applies this floor to each of the five sizes. The order
+    of the five sizes never falls at any grid unit. This floor is the only
+    cause of a tie in that order. The Tiny size and the Small size tie at a
+    grid unit of 7 pixels or less. A smaller grid unit ties more sizes. */
